                "text": "1 in 8 U.S. women are at risk of an invasive breast cancer diagnosis during their lifetime. Groups like the @NBCCStopBC and programs like the DOD\u2019s Breast Cancer Research Program are leading the path forward for breast cancer research and advocacy, and I am committed to uplifting their work and championing this life-saving funding here in the halls of Congress. Special thanks to constituents, Angela from Elkridge and Robyn from Glen Burnie, for visiting!",
