                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Planned Parenthood of Maryland is a crucial part of many Marylanders\u2019 health care, providing lifesaving cancer screenings, STI testing and treatment, and family planning resources to over 33,000 patients in Maryland alone. But the President\u2019s Big Ugly Bill and a recent Supreme Court decision are now on the verge of blocking Medicaid funds for even Planned Parenthood\u2019s non-abortion services. I had a chance to visit Annapolis\u2019 Planned Parenthood facility to discuss how we can continue supporting their lifesaving care in Congress in the face of these cuts.",
                "text_lang": "en",
