                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Since 1978, @chasebrexton has been a leader in preventative care and treatment, serving more than 50,000 Marylanders today, including our most vulnerable communities as a federally qualified health center. Our providers and their patients need Congress to extend these ACA tax credits and address this health care crisis head-on so these clinics can continue providing life-saving, high-quality care to our communities as they always have.",
