                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "For the past 60 years, the University of Maryland Baltimore Washington Medical Center has been providing acute care services \u2013 from heart care to cancer treatment \u2013 to our neighbors. Thank you to President McCollum and the UM BWMC team for organizing an incredible community wellness event to give our neighbors of all ages a chance to learn about mental health and nutrition and access services like the flu vaccines, CPR training, and more. As we navigate this shutdown, it\u2019s on Congress to act and continue funding the programs that make life-saving care affordable and accessible.",
